00:18:56.770 --> 00:18:58.490
Y-Yeah.

00:19:04.460 --> 00:19:08.210
Tapi , itu cukup menakjubkan bahwa ia benar @-@ benar lupa tentang saya .

00:19:08.680 --> 00:19:11.580
